CONTEXT Shops INCLUDES Towns FROM "towns.adl"
CONTEXT Shops IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Shops
{+ A register of shops, which includes the context of towns, as the register of persons does. +}

RELATION located[Shop*Towns.Town] [UNI]
POPULATION located[Shop*Towns.Town] CONTAINS [ ("s1", "Enschede") ; ("s2", "Heerlen") ]

ENDCONTEXT
